\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Angel voices, ever singing
\par Round Thy throne of light,
\par Angel harps, for ever ringing,
\par Rest not day nor night;
\par Thousands only live to bless Thee,
\par Lord of might.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thou who art beyond the farthest
\par Mortal eye can scan,
\par Can it be that Thou regardest
\par Songs of sinful man?
\par Can we know that Thou art near us
\par And wilt hear us?
\par Yea, we can.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Yea, we know that Thou rejoicest
\par O'er each work of Thine;
\par Thou didst  ears, and hands, and voices
\par For Thy praise design,
\par Craftsman's art and music's measure
\par For Thy pleasure
\par All combine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. In Thy house, great God, we offer
\par Of Thine own to Thee,
\par And for Thine acceptance proffer,
\par All unworthily,
\par Hearts, and minds, and hands, and 
\par voices
\par In our choicest
\par Psalmody.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Honour, glory, might, and merit
\par Thine shall ever be,
\par Father, Son, and Holy Spirit,
\par Blessed Trinity.
\par Of the best that Thou hast given
\par Earth and heaven
\par Render Thee.
\par               Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

